TEXT -352 520 Left 5 ;This example is also a test for the err0=1 parameter of the synchronous generator\nto achieve full generator voltage from begin on (see the sinus waveform of generator terminal voltages)\nSince the first timesteps get a very large spike the .tran starting time is 1us\nAlso at the meatering code a new parameter tenable=1u is added as default\nto start the meatering at time>tenable to avoid meatering the spikes
